{
  "_comment": "MonitorCLT production jurisdiction registry. Endpoints byte-verified live 2026-08-18 against each county's ArcGIS service (record counts + field names confirmed). Three arrays: 'sources' run through the adapters->signals pipeline NOW; 'sources_pending_adapter' are verified but need an adapter capability we haven't built (groupBy, spatial-join, or HTML/PDF); 'parcel_sources' are reference parcels that feed the enrichment parcels table, NOT the signals pipeline. source_url for each signal is a per-record ArcGIS /query permalink (record precision). All ArcGIS queries carry outSR=4326 (handled by the adapter) so St. Louis (wkid 102696) etc. return lat/lng. No API keys required for any endpoint.",

  "sources": [
    {
      "registry_id": "meck-permits",
